title: Dependency cycle: stacks/a → stacks/b → stacks/c → stacks/a
status: completed
conclusion: failure

--- summary ---
Waves cannot be ordered because `depends_on` and `reads_state` edges form a cycle. Remove one edge of each cycle, or suppress an inferred edge with `ignore_inferred`.

- `stacks/a → stacks/b → stacks/c → stacks/a`

